 394:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_adc.c ****   *         "ADC_InitTypeDef".
 395:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_adc.c ****   * @note   This function configures the ADC within 2 scopes: scope of entire
